Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.53,0:02:55.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第7季第9集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:02.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.25,0:00:04.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们对我们造不成威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stop any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.82,0:00:07.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有不死之身  你们这群傻帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't be killed, you stupid little chewtoys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.33,0:00:11.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些家伙比你们狡猾多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things are smarter than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.86,0:00:13.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们根本不知道怎么杀它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have a clue how to kill 'em
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.81,0:00:15.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是拖延时间  而你们的计划是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or slow 'em down, and your plan is, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:16.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正面交锋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go right at 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.57,0:00:19.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们忙着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been a little busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忙着猎杀利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunting Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.39,0:00:22.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太多了  你们见过那个迪克(混蛋)了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You met that Dick yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:24.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我宁愿在垃圾堆里打滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd sooner swim through hot garbage
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:26.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不要和你这种下贱的怪物握手言和\N{\fnArial\fs30}than shake hands with a bottom-feeding mutation like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.86,0:00:28.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我永远不会跟你合作  克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd never work with you, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.53,0:00:30.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌那帮王八蛋  把他们都灭了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate the bastard. Squash 'em all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.19,0:00:34.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们得去见一个名叫弗兰克·德弗罗的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to see a fella named Frank Devereaux.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.45,0:00:35.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是鲍比·辛格派我们来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby Singer sent us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:37.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or not. Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.11,0:00:39.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只需要你帮我们远离牢房\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just need you to get us further off the grid,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.75,0:00:41.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同时又能自由行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}but keep us on the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.35,0:00:43.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,清除以前所有的化名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wipe all your old aliases.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:45.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要非常频繁  而且不定期地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change your phones on a very frequent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.90,0:00:47.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换手机  明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}non-schedule schedule, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.89,0:00:49.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能就这么看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just look me in the face
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:50.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我说你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell me you're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.44,0:00:51.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你想听实话吗  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want me to be honest? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.66,0:00:52.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想对你撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like lying to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.31,0:00:54.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.42,0:00:56.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你猜对了  我最近是很焦虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, yeah, you got me there. I been climbing walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.81,0:00:57.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个我有体会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.59,0:01:01.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.84,0:01:19.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(新泽西州  州沃顿森林  松林泥炭地)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.92,0:01:39.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.12,0:01:51.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是由自然之声出品的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Nature Sounds'
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.39,0:01:56.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《自然之声》第四辑"舒缓的海洋之声"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sounds of Nature," Volume 4, "Soothing Seas."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.25,0:02:19.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞毛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.07,0:02:27.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琳妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leanne!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.44,0:02:37.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:39.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琳妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leanne!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:50.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是由自然之声出品的《自然之声》\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Nature Sounds' "Sounds of Nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.71,0:03:01.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(新泽西州  哈蒙顿)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.67,0:03:03.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把电线剥好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you strip enough wire?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:05.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剥好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I stripped enough wire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.83,0:03:09.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.72,0:03:21.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.16,0:03:21.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看  我就说可以吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:30.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真惬意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, isn't this cozy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.66,0:03:32.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.41,0:03:36.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,六号旅馆晚上不给留灯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Motel 6 just ain't leaving the light on anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一点上我要谨遵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm taking a page out of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:39.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗兰克·德弗罗的圣经指引\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank Devereaux's Bible on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.59,0:03:40.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都想抓你们的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's out to get you --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.70,0:03:43.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,疑心病就是情理之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paranoia is just plain common sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.15,0:03:46.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种日子我们过了好几周了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weeks, guys. Weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.09,0:03:48.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能洗冷水澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been living with cold showers,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.03,0:03:50.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃凉饭  没有一样是热的\N{\fnArial\fs30}cold hot pockets, cold freaking everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.49,0:03:52.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们从没这么落魄过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this is the bottom that we're living in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.33,0:03:53.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys get that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.24,0:03:55.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面不知有多少像切特那样的大嘴怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many big mouths are out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.04,0:03:57.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在追查我们的信用卡记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}running card traces, like Chet,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.21,0:03:59.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是用别的方法追杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}or hunting us down god knows what ways?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.86,0:04:01.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在这个时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, now's not the time
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.53,0:04:03.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能出去抛头露面\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be laying our bed rolls out on the grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.37,0:04:04.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非万不得已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if we can help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:10.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,屋漏偏逢连夜雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.67,0:04:14.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是蠢到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:17.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们的生活质量低到了极点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our quality of life is crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.70,0:04:21.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到处是炼狱都受不了的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got purgatory's least wanted everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.37,0:04:24.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们还要为"天下大乱"操心\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're on our third "the world's screwed" issue
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.88,0:04:26.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三年之内这是第三次了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}in, what, three years?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.11,0:04:29.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们开着这辆破车从悬崖边上回来有两次了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've steered the bus away from the cliff twice already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.52,0:04:30.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总得有人出手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's got to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.61,0:04:32.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万一这辆车就想开下悬崖呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if the bus wants to go over the cliff?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.52,0:04:34.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得世界想要毁灭吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think the world wants to end?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.24,0:04:36.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得要不是咱们每年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that if we didn't take its belt
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.72,0:04:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,横拦竖挡\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all its pens away each year
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.10,0:04:40.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界早就自行了断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that, yeah, the whole enchilada would have offed itself already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.73,0:04:42.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胳膊扭不过大腿的  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop trying to wrestle with the big picture, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.75,0:04:44.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到头来只会伤到自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna hurt your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.52,0:04:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the guff?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.94,0:04:51.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近在南部松林泥炭地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, there have been a rash of sightings
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.67,0:04:53.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有不少人目击到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}all over the southern pine barrens --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:56.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一种移动迅速的类人生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}a strange, fast-moving, human-like creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.13,0:04:57.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当地人甚至给它起了个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locals even have a name for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.12,0:05:00.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泽西魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Jersey Devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.58,0:05:03.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为那只是当地人瞎编的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that was just local tall-tale crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.06,0:05:04.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最早在两百年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}The area's history of sightings
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.36,0:05:06.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就有人见过这种怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}goes back more than two centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.01,0:05:09.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人说它长着蝙蝠翅膀  还有人说它长着角\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some accounts gave it bat wings, others horns,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.64,0:05:11.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有尾巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}a tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.63,0:05:12.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.39,0:05:15.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  还有马头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, a horse's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.75,0:05:18.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看草图倒像是楚巴卡(星球大战人物)的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sketch looks more like a Chewbacca head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.75,0:05:18.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.55,0:05:20.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来只是搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds kind of mixed-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:23.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  应该让它和日本机器人过过招\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, kind of like it should be fighting a Japanese robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.26,0:05:25.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是不是搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, mixed-up or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.36,0:05:27.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它貌似刚刚杀了个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}it sounds like it might just have a body count.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:34.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"惊现人肉煎饼  露营热季降温"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Camping High Season Harshed by Human Burrito"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:36.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  有家伙把一个露营者挂到树上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Something hung a camper up in a tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:39.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隔着睡袋把他给生吃活剥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then ate him alive right through his sleeping bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.53,0:05:41.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的妻子也失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His wife hasn't been seen, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.49,0:05:43.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另外  这三周以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, there have been four other missing persons
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.58,0:05:45.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还另有四人被报下落不明\N{\fnArial\fs30}reported in the last three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.38,0:05:48.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据州警察称  这是野熊所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}State troopers -- get this -- are saying it's a rogue bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.93,0:05:50.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是嘛  你什么时候见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, of course, when was the last time
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.07,0:05:52.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,野熊把猎物吊在树上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you saw a bear string up its own praeda?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.28,0:05:53.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,树林里肯定有怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's out there in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.85,0:05:57.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们正好可以趁机会去树林里打个猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we're going honest to goodness wilderness hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.78,0:05:59.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好久没动双管猎枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't used my .30-30 in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.92,0:06:00.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  大英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Davey Crockett,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.97,0:06:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游猎还是等到明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, safari's gonna have to wait till tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.95,0:06:05.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们做完调查再说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and after our suit-and-tie dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.17,0:06:07.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要先确定这不是某个退隐山林的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll make sure this is not just some backwoods crackhead
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.81,0:06:10.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傻缺豪华露营者干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}who likes to roll glampers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.47,0:06:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么叫豪华露营者\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's a glamper?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.56,0:06:13.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆解释一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.39,0:06:15.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们配有高端设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}High-end camper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.97,0:06:18.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电视  交流电  无线网\N{\fnArial\fs30}TV, A.C., Wi-Fi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.83,0:06:21.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回归自然  各种便捷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to nature, zero inconvenience.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:22.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真傻缺\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's idiotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.23,0:06:23.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.59,0:06:25.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,某些人就是不懂得享受生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people just don't know how to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.15,0:06:28.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(比格森餐厅)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.45,0:06:30.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(限时供应  火鸭鸡三明治)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.39,0:06:35.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃文斯护林员\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Ranger Evans --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.25,0:06:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫我里克就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, you can call me Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.74,0:06:38.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里克护林员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ranger Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.20,0:06:45.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你发现了米切尔·雷伯恩  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you were the one who found Mitchell Rayburn, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.54,0:06:47.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  那个人肉煎饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The human burrito.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.93,0:06:51.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,州警察将此案认定为野熊袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}State police have it down as a bear attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.35,0:06:56.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我读了州警察的报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I read what the state police says.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.74,0:06:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可不是棕熊干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was no rogue brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.55,0:07:01.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然  还有其他人报告说看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, some others reported seeing something
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.19,0:07:03.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更加诡异的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little, you know, weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.55,0:07:05.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做了12年的护林员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've been a ranger for 12 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.36,0:07:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你说句实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.88,0:07:10.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不知道哪儿究竟有啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no idea what's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.27,0:07:15.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那儿很大  很多树啊什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big. Lot of trees and whatnot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.75,0:07:17.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我跟你们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you this, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.36,0:07:20.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要对大自然抱有敬畏之心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to respect mother nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.51,0:07:23.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然的话  她就把你吊起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You respect her, or she's gonna string you up,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.33,0:07:25.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撕开睡袋把你啃个干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she'll eat your ass right through the gore-tex.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.82,0:07:29.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说你认为是大自然干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're thinking it's mother nature?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.63,0:07:32.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样  我和菲尔这几周\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, me and Phil, we've been finding, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.03,0:07:35.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知是什么东西吃剩的残渣\N{\fnArial\fs30}something's leftovers for weeks --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.68,0:07:38.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鹿的残骸  獾子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deer remains, badger,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.75,0:07:39.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别人丢的宠物\N{\fnArial\fs30}missing pets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.12,0:07:40.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菲尔是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Phil?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.18,0:07:43.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,护林队队长助理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assistant Chief Ranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.39,0:07:46.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.29,0:07:49.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有好几天没见着菲尔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen Phil in a couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.25,0:07:54.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管他在哪个驻地  也该打个电话过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's supposed to call from whatever station he's checking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.06,0:07:55.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you think maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.08,0:07:57.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位护林队队长助理失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}your assistant Chief Ranger might be missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:07:59.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也许该做个报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should probably report that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.50,0:08:05.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失陪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.97,0:08:08.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么你就\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.57,0:08:09.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}enjoy your lunch...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.39,0:08:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里克护林员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ranger Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.73,0:08:19.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.78,0:08:22.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我检查了一下尸体...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I took a look at the cadaver --
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.45,0:08:23.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,残余的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's left of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.98,0:08:25.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太惨了点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a happy camper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.68,0:08:29.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不清楚泽西魔的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't have any stats on a Jersey Devil,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:31.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但从尸体上的啃咬半径来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the bite radius on the vic's wounds --
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.81,0:08:33.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比利维坦的小多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's too small for a Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.75,0:08:37.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还留下了心房什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's still got a ventricle and some change,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.38,0:08:38.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我想不是狼人干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I doubt we're talking werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.24,0:08:41.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,食人魔吃东西不剩饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a Wendigo don't leave no scraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.65,0:08:44.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃午饭吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.73,0:08:45.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.84,0:08:47.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  布兰登\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Uh, Brandon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.48,0:08:49.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有座位吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We grab a booth?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.31,0:08:52.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  孬货  女服务员会招呼你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, douchewad, a hostess will seat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.93,0:08:54.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我他妈像个女服务员吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look like a freaking hostess?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.68,0:08:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你希望自个儿像女服务员吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to look like a hostess?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.62,0:09:04.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才的话不怎么说得通啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That didn't really make sense, what you... said.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.95,0:09:06.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:09.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望不要在布兰登的地盘用餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sure hope we don't get Brandon's section.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.95,0:09:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大呆鸟要的响尾蛇汤和沙拉组合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sidewinder soup and salad combo goes to big bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.79,0:09:16.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯娃娃(男孩玩偶)要的火鸭鸡三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}TDK slammer to ken doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:19.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有怪叔叔要的小份健康餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a little heart-smart for creepy uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.06,0:09:21.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你生谁的气呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:23.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生你的气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are my problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:29.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布兰登一股脑把火气全发出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Brandon's got his flare all up in a bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.50,0:09:31.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  小费是别想要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. There goes his 18%.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.32,0:09:33.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之呢  那个护林队队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, the Chief Ranger --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.96,0:09:35.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为他压根不信泽西魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he believes in the Jersey Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.07,0:09:40.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说到这个  你有没有觉得他像是嗑大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, by the way, did he seem a little, uh, stoned to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.00,0:09:43.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说里克护林员  是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ranger Rick? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.34,0:09:45.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定找了片荒地种了一片大麻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely growing his own on the back 40
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:46.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把拿来挣钱的那份都抽掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and smoking all the profits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.25,0:09:51.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来他确实认为那里有什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did seem to think that there was something --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.53,0:09:53.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这三明治太好吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that is good sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.34,0:09:54.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你点的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell did you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.41,0:09:58.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新辣味火鸭鸡三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}New pepperjack turducken slammer --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:10:00.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,限时供应\N{\fnArial\fs30}limited time only.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.63,0:10:03.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各种家禽的肉胡乱塞在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bunch of birds shoved up inside each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.03,0:10:05.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿造物主开涮呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't play god like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.67,0:10:07.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好意思诋毁我的食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't look at me sideways from that --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.16,0:10:09.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个古怪的中国鸡肉沙拉又算啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}that chinese chicken geezer salad there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.35,0:10:10.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这个可好吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.90,0:10:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是最好吃的三种家禽肉的完美组合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the perfect storm of your top-three edible birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.32,0:10:18.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  不管怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, anyways, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.62,0:10:20.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个护林员确实认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ranger did seem to think
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.64,0:10:22.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沃顿森林里确实有什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was something out in Wharton forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.19,0:10:24.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来是时候去打猎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then I'd say it's safari time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.62,0:10:27.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看看她  难道你不认为她很胖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at her! You're telling me she's not fat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.07,0:10:29.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  去你妈的  迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Up yours, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.14,0:10:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你妈逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shove it right up yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.17,0:10:37.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管他呢  还是吃我的好东西吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, anyway, back to bigger and better things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.33,0:11:13.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几头鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.91,0:11:16.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是为了争地盘顶着脑袋打了一架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head-butting over turf probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.02,0:11:18.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赢的肯定是另外一头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure the other fella won.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.78,0:11:30.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.45,0:11:34.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在成为猎魔人之前  是一个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you were a hunter, you were actually a...hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.65,0:11:38.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我小时候靠打猎填饱肚子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, we shot our dinner when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.45,0:11:40.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以前常带我们打猎  记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used to take us hunting. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.57,0:11:42.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸有活儿干  就把我们丢给你照看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad had a case, he'd just dump us on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.11,0:11:44.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼  我们所知的大多数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot, you must have taught us
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.22,0:11:45.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,野外追踪技能都应该是你教的\N{\fnArial\fs30}most of the outdoor tracking we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.82,0:11:47.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  能教进去多少算多少吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what I could get to stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:50.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你们两个小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never could get you little grubs
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.10,0:11:52.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝一头鹿扣动扳机都做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}to pull a trigger on a single deer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.17,0:11:53.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说小鹿斑比吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talking about Bambi, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.88,0:11:56.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么能杀斑比呢  傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't shoot Bambi, jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.40,0:11:58.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要杀的是斑比它妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shoot Bambi's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:11.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们找到菲尔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, looks like we found phil.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.82,0:12:20.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特工们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.14,0:12:23.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我接到电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I got your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.43,0:12:26.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不太清楚你们说的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not sure I got what you were saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.71,0:12:34.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  看来我们找到菲尔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. I think we found phil.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:35.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.71,0:12:38.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我应该向上头汇报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I should probably call this in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.12,0:12:43.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  这样最好  里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. Solid move, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:58.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是埃文斯护林员在阿切尔区域汇报  请讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, this is Ranger Evans up at Acher's point. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.63,0:13:04.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重复一遍  我是护林队队长埃文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, repeat. This is Chief Ranger Evans.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.06,0:13:05.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在阿切尔区域发现了情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a situation out at Acher's point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.59,0:13:09.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,护林员  有什么东西过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ranger, I think we've got company.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.08,0:13:11.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.15,0:13:14.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,护林员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ranger!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.78,0:13:18.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃文斯护林员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ranger Evans!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.95,0:13:21.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,护林员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ranger!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.90,0:13:29.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他带到树上去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got him up in the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.09,0:13:35.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-关灯  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lights off. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.32,0:13:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  鲍比  这样真的好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, bobby, you think that's really a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.70,0:13:40.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  关灯  注意听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, shut off, and listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.59,0:13:49.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙在吃里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn thing is eating Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.38,0:13:50.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  我还喜欢里克呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I liked rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.44,0:14:10.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好枪法  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Nice shot, bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.96,0:14:11.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毫无疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.52,0:14:13.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各有各的能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all got our gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.80,0:14:28.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里克护林员的残骸呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the rest of Ranger Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.80,0:14:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,护林员报告了他的位置  会有人找到他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ranger called in his 10-20. His own will find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.01,0:14:35.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还有事要忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got crap to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.55,0:14:51.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙看起来很苗条  可力气真是大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Built like a supermodel, but the thing was strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.21,0:14:52.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一点毫无疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for damn sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.44,0:14:55.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞬间就能扛着一个成年人爬到树上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carried a full-grown man up a tree in nothing flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.07,0:14:57.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可只用一颗子弹就搞定它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it only took one bullet to bring it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.69,0:15:01.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且不是银子弹  只是普通的子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not even a silver bullet, just a bullet-bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.12,0:15:15.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那颗子弹只是震晕了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}First one must have just stunned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:22.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  我们在它的肥裤里找找身份证\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, let's check its hulk pants for some I.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.76,0:15:31.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀  都有点腐蚀到皮革了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that is just gonna ruin the leather.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.20,0:15:35.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.19,0:15:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉很好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I feel great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.49,0:15:39.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰拉德·勃劳德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gerald Browder,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.82,0:15:42.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本镇居民  身高一米七七  褐发蓝眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, lived here in town, 5'9", brown hair and blue eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.67,0:15:45.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,213斤\N{\fnArial\fs30}235 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.78,0:15:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很显然  他减掉了一点赘肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, apparently, he's lost a little pudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.94,0:15:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是腹腔带的副作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's a-a lap-band side effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.66,0:16:17.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.09,0:16:21.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们最好把杰拉德解剖开一探究竟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we better have a look under Gerald's hood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.26,0:16:27.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.81,0:16:30.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它的脏器全泡在这东西里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its organs are swimming in the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:31.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们饿不饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys getting hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.35,0:16:35.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.02,0:16:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.52,0:16:40.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的胃\N{\fnArial\fs30}His stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.57,0:16:42.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为一个在节食的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a guy on a diet,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.95,0:16:44.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰里倒是没少吃啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gerry here packed it in pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.99,0:16:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是人肉啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's human right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.82,0:16:48.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是里克新鲜的肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fresh Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.28,0:16:50.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我再看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.56,0:16:51.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.04,0:16:55.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,松塔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}pine cone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.83,0:16:59.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一条没拆封的口香糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack of gum in the wrapper.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.49,0:17:04.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个...这个时间长些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's -- that's older.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.70,0:17:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是菲尔护林员或是那个宿营者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe like a -- maybe Ranger Phil or the camper.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.11,0:17:08.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.50,0:17:10.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来像...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like a --
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:12.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  这是一个猫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's a -- that's a cat's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.59,0:17:17.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃一两个宿营者是一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}A glamper or two is one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.29,0:17:19.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但肯定是饿得不行了才会吃一个猫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you got to be damn hungry to eat a cat's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.76,0:17:26.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看这啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.26,0:17:29.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.26,0:17:29.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是奥兹医生(健康类电视节目)  但...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no Dr. Oz, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.21,0:17:34.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想这是他的肾上腺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that's his adrenal glands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.38,0:17:35.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. And?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.56,0:17:38.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是跟旅馆肥皂一样大啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meant to be the size of hotel bar soap...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.87,0:17:40.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且是亮橘色\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bright orange.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.05,0:17:45.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  这似乎能解释他巨大的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that might help explain the strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.87,0:17:48.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不管它是什么  总之不是泽西魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, but whatever this thing is, it's not the Jersey Devil,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.84,0:17:50.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但它肯定也不再是杰拉德·勃劳德\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it sure as hell ain't Gerald Browder anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.57,0:17:52.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  伙计们  说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, guys, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.47,0:17:56.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以吃晚饭了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.00,0:18:08.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰拉德·勃劳德  35岁  个体户\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gerald Browder, 35, self-employed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.21,0:18:10.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,空调修理工\N{\fnArial\fs30}air-conditioning repairman,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.47,0:18:11.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是第三个失踪人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}missing person number three,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.97,0:18:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,八天前失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}disappeared eight days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.28,0:18:14.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这倒是能解释是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that explains all the people
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.82,0:18:16.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这八天里吃了那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who got eaten in the last eight days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:18.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.49,0:18:19.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但问题是  他是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question is, what happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.47,0:18:32.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.81,0:18:34.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, so, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.03,0:18:37.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不操这个的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not that worried about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.11,0:18:39.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.43,0:18:41.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺奇怪的  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's funny, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.93,0:18:45.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真他妈的不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could give two shakes of a rat's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.59,0:18:47.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.04,0:18:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他妈不在乎还是他不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do rats shake their ass, or is it something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.65,0:19:18.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这个给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.49,0:19:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa! Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.40,0:19:24.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这鬼三明治里放的什么鬼鸡肉啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's some funky chicken in the TDK slammer, ain't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.34,0:19:27.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.59,0:19:31.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这太傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.36,0:19:33.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是我三明治惹的祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sandwich didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.05,0:19:35.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你们认为你们能找到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you think you're gonna find.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.15,0:19:38.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有点不正常啊  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something wrong with you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.18,0:19:42.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开什么玩笑  我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding? I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.40,0:19:46.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我感觉还是很不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I -- I actually feel great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.84,0:19:50.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是几个月来我感觉最好的一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best I've felt in a couple months.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.02,0:19:52.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡的事  黑色的胶状物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass? Black goo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.58,0:19:54.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在都不在乎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even care anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.27,0:19:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且更妙的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what's even better?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.72,0:19:58.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是我不介意我这种不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care that I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.94,0:20:03.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想把我的三明治拿回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want my damn slammer back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.76,0:20:05.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  你完全是嗑大了的样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you are completely stoned,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.37,0:20:06.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟那个里克护林员一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like Ranger Rick was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.90,0:20:09.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像比格森餐厅里那些埋头大吃的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like the dinner rush back at Biggerson's,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.50,0:20:11.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都爱死了火鸡鸭肉三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}and everybody's loving the turducken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.07,0:20:16.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你把我的三明治惹火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you pissed off my sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.73,0:20:24.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我体内有那东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That -- that's in me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.54,0:20:25.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}O-only half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.84,0:20:28.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这鼻涕状的东西看上去挺眼熟啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that snot look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.38,0:20:30.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是什么把杰里·勃劳德变成了南瓜头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so whatever turned Gerry Browder into a pumpkin head...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.42,0:20:33.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它正在把迪恩变成一个大傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}and is currently turning Dean into an idiot --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.55,0:20:34.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还在这呢  就在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right here. Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.78,0:20:38.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而它就在比格森餐厅的火鸡鸭三明治里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is in the turducken slammer at Biggerson's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.75,0:20:40.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-对  -在肉里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - It's in the meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.43,0:20:46.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果现在我不是这么冷静  我肯定会吐\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I wasn't so chilled out right now, I would puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.45,0:20:55.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(比格森餐厅)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.16,0:20:56.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.16,0:21:03.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在把二劲睡过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's sleeping it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.25,0:21:05.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撑得昏睡不醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tryptophan coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.35,0:21:08.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为他会没事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you think he's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.03,0:21:09.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  他没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.79,0:21:11.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.62,0:21:13.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说你不担心他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you don't worry about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.15,0:21:15.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.25,0:21:16.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是说在他吃那三明治之前吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the turducken?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.28,0:21:19.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我其实是想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, I kind of mean more like, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.73,0:21:22.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我崩溃之后...\N{\fnArial\fs30}more like ever since my head broke...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.22,0:21:24.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后我们失去了小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we lost Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.95,0:21:26.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有感觉到他...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you ever feel like he's --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.37,0:21:28.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他虽然举止没有什么变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's going through the same motions
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.52,0:21:30.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他不是原来那个迪恩了  你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's not the same Dean, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.54,0:21:31.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么能不变呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could he be?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.86,0:21:33.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  但是如果...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, yeah, but what if --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.27,0:21:35.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果什么  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}what if - what, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.24,0:21:39.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很担心他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you worry about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.75,0:21:41.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也很担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All he does is worry about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.33,0:21:42.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你们俩还剩谁能正常过日子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's left to live their own life here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.61,0:21:45.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two of you --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.60,0:21:47.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩这辈子斗妖魔鬼怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}aren't you full up just playing snuffleupagus
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.72,0:21:49.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不够烦的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the devil all the live long?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.82,0:21:54.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.57,0:21:55.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒无所谓老能看见路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing Lucifer's fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.05,0:21:58.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.64,0:22:01.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是说那挺有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not saying it's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.87,0:22:02.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但跟你说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, to be honest with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.62,0:22:05.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把它当成最好的情况了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kind of see it as the best-case scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.64,0:22:07.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.57,0:22:11.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少我的疯狂还在一定范围之内  懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least all my crazy's under one umbrella, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.44,0:22:15.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我大概知道我面对的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kind of know what I'm dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.29,0:22:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有很多人比我还惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of people got it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.55,0:22:22.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一直是一个很有内涵的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always were one deep little son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.22,0:22:25.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢着  慢着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.56,0:22:26.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.66,0:22:54.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们得跟上他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess we follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.80,0:23:34.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(中西部肉食及家禽集散中心)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.96,0:23:44.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真奇怪  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's weird, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.48,0:23:47.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像比格森餐厅这样的全国连锁店\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, national franchise like Biggerson's
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.06,0:23:47.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会从一个像\N{\fnArial\fs30}getting meat from a place
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.96,0:23:50.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假货批发市场似的地方进肉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that looks like it wholesales Hong Kong knockoffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.54,0:23:53.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  对  是有点奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Yeah. It's a little weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.48,0:23:55.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.02,0:23:57.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们等到他们关店门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we wait till they close up shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.85,0:23:58.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后去四周看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go take a look around?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.74,0:24:01.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.17,0:24:11.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.08,0:24:24.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是埃德加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edgar.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.31,0:24:27.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leviathans.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.07,0:24:36.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.43,0:24:39.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.01,0:24:52.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有劳把他和其他人放在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put him with the others, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.15,0:24:57.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃德加  跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edgar. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.95,0:25:00.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直忙着实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been so busy with this experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.44,0:25:02.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都不知道你已经回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't even realize you were back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.48,0:25:04.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这挺重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh, big stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.57,0:25:06.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是因为这个试验才回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm back because of the experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.70,0:25:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.88,0:25:10.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你在改良配方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you were refining the formula.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.01,0:25:12.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  的确是的  现在进展十分好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Absolutely. And it's going great.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.66,0:25:14.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浓度降低  但吸收速率升高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The absorption rate is up in lower concentrations.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.77,0:25:17.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但还是没有解决副作用的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it didn't solve our little issue with adverse reactions.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.71,0:25:19.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.65,0:25:20.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没完全解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.80,0:25:35.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烧死他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.91,0:25:37.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.32,0:25:40.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们反映了重要的试验数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they represent crucial test data.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.40,0:25:41.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,添加剂配方哪里出了问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the additive formula went wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.76,0:25:43.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的初步估测哪里失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}where my initial projections failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.94,0:25:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪克要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.48,0:25:50.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烧死他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.80,0:26:03.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里什么事都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing happening back here at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.06,0:26:05.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.33,0:26:06.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还在埋头苦干呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're pretty dug in,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.31,0:26:08.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你转一圈四处看看就回来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so why don't you finish circling and head on back?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.68,0:26:13.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的头怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.05,0:26:18.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得那个三明治已经消耗得差不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think the slammer's pretty much wore off.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.36,0:26:20.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那之后我喝了二十杯咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}In between that and the 20 cups of coffee,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.08,0:26:21.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在精神的很\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm nicely tense and alarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.86,0:26:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没说那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't talking about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.94,0:26:26.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Bobby, don't --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.63,0:26:29.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别现在来给我心理分析  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't go all Sigmund Freud on me right now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.38,0:26:31.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才刚被一个三明治下药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got drugged by a sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.61,0:26:34.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想谈谈你的新党派路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to talk about your new party line.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.09,0:26:36.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,党派\N{\fnArial\fs30}Party?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.13,0:26:38.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么  我甚至都不投票\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? I don't even vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.48,0:26:41.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"这世界就是要自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The world's a suicide case.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.27,0:26:43.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们拯救了它  它转头就又要寻死了"\N{\fnArial\fs30}We save it, it just steals more pills"?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.11,0:26:46.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  我在这里  我在办这件案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, I'm here, okay? I'm on the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.11,0:26:47.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么问题呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.16,0:26:49.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我目睹了许多猎魔人的生生死死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen a lot of hunters live and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.73,0:26:52.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说话开始像那些死人的了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're starting to talk like one of the dead ones, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.05,0:26:54.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我讲话就是一个正常人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm talking the way a person talks
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.61,0:26:57.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经承受太多  却不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they've had it, when they can't figure out
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.16,0:26:59.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当初自己为何会认为这些事很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}why they used to think all this mattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.85,0:27:01.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个可怜可悲的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you poor, sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.63,0:27:05.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是个正常人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.43,0:27:06.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.79,0:27:07.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.89,0:27:09.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你试过不再猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried to hang it up
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.33,0:27:12.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟莉莎还有本过正常人的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}and be a person with Lisa and Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.38,0:27:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而现在你还是在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now here you are
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.70,0:27:15.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟一个刻薄的老笨蛋待在装满了枪的车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a mean old coot and a van full of guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.19,0:27:18.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子  这可不是正常人会做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't person behavior, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.42,0:27:19.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是个猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a hunter,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.24,0:27:22.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是说你在干什么活儿就是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}meaning you're whatever the job you're doing today.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.56,0:27:24.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是变成了安妮·塞克斯顿(自白派代表诗人)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you get a case of the Anne Sexton's,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.90,0:27:24.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.67,0:27:25.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总会有什么东西偷袭你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's gonna come up behind you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.72,0:27:27.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后让你身首异处\N{\fnArial\fs30}and rip your fool head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.54,0:27:30.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  你给我找到振作起来的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you find your reasons to get back in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.84,0:27:34.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不管是爱是恨  抑或一个十元的赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care if it's love or spite or a $10 bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.23,0:27:36.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经参加过够多葬礼了  我认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been to enough funerals. I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.66,0:27:41.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你敢死在我前面  我就杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You die before me, and I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.61,0:27:47.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得凑点钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to scrape some money together,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.06,0:27:48.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你弄个公寓什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}get you a condo or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.98,0:27:51.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有情况了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.68,0:28:07.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll be a squirrel in a skirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.76,0:28:10.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他妈的迪克·罗曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Dick frigging Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.97,0:28:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁是他妈的迪克·罗曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell is dick frigging roman?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.76,0:28:14.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亿万富翁迪克·罗曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billionaire Dick Roman,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.85,0:28:16.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出席近日的一个新闻发布会\N{\fnArial\fs30}seen here at a recent press conference,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.65,0:28:18.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在过去几个月中\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been on the corporate-takeover warpath 
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.69,0:28:19.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直忙于吞并对头公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the last several months
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.81,0:28:21.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丝毫没有心慈手软\N{\fnArial\fs30}and shows no signs of relenting.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.81,0:28:23.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信以前的好的美国价值观\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe in good old American values,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.50,0:28:25.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如说永无止境的发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}like unlimited growth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.01,0:28:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但正如我一直说的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's like I always say --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.00,0:28:29.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你要赢  你就得是佼佼者\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you want to win, then you got to be the shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.79,0:28:32.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而大鱼吃小鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a shark's got to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.48,0:28:34.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个很好的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a great question.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.15,0:28:36.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们近来是吞并了几家公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we have made new acquisitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.38,0:28:38.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不靠恶意收购\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe in hostile takeovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.68,0:28:42.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我靠的是兼并  然后反客为主\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe in merging... and coming out on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.06,0:28:44.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论是掌舵他赢得美国杯的快艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether at the helm of his America's Cup-Winning Yacht
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.63,0:28:46.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是他的《财富》500强公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}or one of his Fortune 500 companies,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.59,0:28:48.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗曼一直都是焦点人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman has never shied away from the spotlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.85,0:28:51.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗曼破纪录系列励志研讨会文集\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman's record-breaking series of motivational seminars,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.67,0:28:53.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《入乡随俗》销量\N{\fnArial\fs30}"When in Rome," have outsold
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.06,0:28:55.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已远超市场上的其他致富类项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}every other money-making program on the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.59,0:28:57.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是全国步枪协会合唱团团员\N{\fnArial\fs30}A vocal member of the NRA
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.15,0:28:59.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是第二修正案坚定的拥护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a steadfast supporter of the Second Amendment,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.17,0:29:00.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗曼也开始吸引\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman has started attracting
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.47,0:29:02.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一些保守派政客的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}some conservative political attention, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.83,0:29:05.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗曼很冷酷  但他长得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman is ruthless, but good-looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.89,0:29:07.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为他会成为一个很好的候选人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he'll make a great candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.28,0:29:09.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是一个好问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another great question.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.39,0:29:12.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我现在不会为政治职务竞选\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I am not running for political office at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.45,0:29:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我的确有排名第一的畅销书\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do have a number-one bestseller.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.72,0:29:17.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我勒个去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.30,0:29:19.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.04,0:29:20.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是美国前50名\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one of the top 50
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.95,0:29:22.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最具影响力的人之一  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}most powerful men in America, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.74,0:29:24.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自上个月起排名第35\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says here top 35 as of last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.39,0:29:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's all making sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.12,0:29:29.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得克劳力一直抱怨说讨厌迪克吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember when Crowley kept going on about hating Dick?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.84,0:29:32.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为他是泛指呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he was just being general.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.28,0:29:35.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果利维坦找上了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if the Leviathan got to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.17,0:29:37.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就意味着他们的计划比我们想象的\N{\fnArial\fs30}then that means they're playing on a much bigger board
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.51,0:29:38.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要大得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}than we were thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.65,0:29:41.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那怎么办  我们不可能以火力取胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what, then? I mean, we can't exactly outgun them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.75,0:29:43.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行  但我们可以先发制人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but we got the drop on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.94,0:29:45.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还有个机会能搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means we got a chance to figure out
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.11,0:29:46.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人究竟在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what these guys are really doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.21,0:29:51.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么弄到那货的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Where'd you get that mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.74,0:29:54.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从弗兰克的监控设备大全里借的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's on loan from Frank's big brother collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.52,0:29:57.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它能感应到半英里外的窗玻璃上的音频振动\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll pick up vocal vibrations from window glass at half a mile.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.81,0:30:01.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是时候查清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's time to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.82,0:30:03.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些恶心的混蛋在搞什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}what these ugly bastards are up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.56,0:30:13.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,病人被全身麻醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The patient is put under general anesthesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.98,0:30:15.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,眼睛被固定住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The eye is immobilized,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.99,0:30:19.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后用手术刀分离视神经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then a scalpel is used to sever the optic nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.17,0:30:26.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我放入火鸭鸡三明治里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The food additive that I've introduced
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.98,0:30:29.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,食物添加剂几乎百分百的有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the turducken has a near-100% rate of effectiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.97,0:30:31.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦实验对象吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the subject tries it,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.22,0:30:33.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在几个小时内就会想要更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}they crave more within a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.98,0:30:36.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首剂就能作用于其DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the very first dose, it starts to work on their DNA,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.26,0:30:38.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,减慢他们的新陈代谢  导致体重增加\N{\fnArial\fs30}slowing their metabolism, causing weight gain,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.48,0:30:40.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还能抑制他们的情感波动\N{\fnArial\fs30}and dampening their emotional range,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.29,0:30:43.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们洋洋自得\N{\fnArial\fs30}which makes them perfectly complacent.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.42,0:30:45.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正如你所见\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.40,0:30:48.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还没注意到奶奶已经过世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have yet to notice that Grandma is no longer with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.07,0:30:56.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确  如果做好的肉饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}True, if you leave out a cooked patty
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.13,0:30:56.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一小时后还没下肚\N{\fnArial\fs30}for more than an hour,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.94,0:30:58.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就会恢复成  怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}it reverts back to a somewhat, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.94,0:30:59.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不太诱人的状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}unappealing state,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.97,0:31:02.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但目前还没人剩饭呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I have yet to have a case of leftovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.57,0:31:04.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我喜欢什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I love?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.36,0:31:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了手球和清新的夏敦埃酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, besides handball and a really crisp Chardonnay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.75,0:31:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就喜欢进步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.00,0:31:11.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道进步来源于合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know that progress comes from collaboration,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.22,0:31:14.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以此时此刻才特别激动人心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is what makes moments like this so thrilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.30,0:31:15.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴能听到这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so glad to hear you say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.83,0:31:18.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那现在你能说说关于你失败的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what can you tell me about your failures?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.61,0:31:20.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm? My...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.44,0:31:24.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些个流窜出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ones that went off the rails
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.61,0:31:26.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们可是吃了你做的美餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}after they ate your little treats.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.79,0:31:28.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, um... They're, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.98,0:31:32.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-失败是成功之母  -错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They've been very instructive. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.25,0:31:34.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要让他们满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I asked for complacency.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.49,0:31:35.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不是自大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not complacency
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.65,0:31:38.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更不是那0.03%亢奋的食人者\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a 0.03% margin of hyperadrenalized cannibalism.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.76,0:31:41.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会处理好这些的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will have this under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.05,0:31:45.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惊现人肉煎饼  露营热季降温\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Camping high season harshed by human burrito"?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.30,0:31:46.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前是不是说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I ever mentioned how I feel
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.49,0:31:49.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对我们的大业上报纸是什么态度\N{\fnArial\fs30}about our little forays making the papers?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.76,0:31:52.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说一次  合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, again, collaboration.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.40,0:31:54.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.59,0:31:57.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想把这次的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to turn this little mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.67,0:32:00.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变为一次极佳的教育机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}into a big fat teachable moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.30,0:32:02.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you help me with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.44,0:32:06.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.08,0:32:07.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.06,0:32:10.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这边没动静  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our side's still dead, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.41,0:32:11.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那边怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.44,0:32:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.49,0:32:17.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got -- hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.22,0:32:21.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有动静了  我这边  二楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got movement -- my side, second floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.18,0:32:22.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会议室\N{\fnArial\fs30}meeting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.41,0:32:24.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会重新安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll reschedule
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.28,0:32:25.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟议员在周二中午会餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the senator for lunch Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.74,0:32:27.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以在下午商讨大主教管区的事务\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can deal with the archdiocese in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.61,0:32:28.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.56,0:32:29.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪克  听我解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick, please, let me explain to you
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.93,0:32:31.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的项目能提供什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what our program has to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.29,0:32:34.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  让我告诉你为什么要关闭你的项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Let me explain why we're shutting your program down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.56,0:32:36.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关闭项目  这不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're shutting it down? No, you can't --
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.16,0:32:39.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我关闭它是因为一条黄金法则\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm shutting it down because of the one golden rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.31,0:32:40.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.08,0:32:41.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道  "不要让事情见报"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. "Don't make the papers."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.68,0:32:42.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I promise that --
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.72,0:32:44.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  黄金法则是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the golden rule is
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.34,0:32:46.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界上没有怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's no such thing as monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.83,0:32:48.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何闹鬼闹怪的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything stirs their little pots to the contrary --
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.73,0:32:50.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都对我们的计划非常不利\N{\fnArial\fs30}very bad for our plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.95,0:32:52.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  我们怎么用你的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how can I use your mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.89,0:32:54.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,教育你那些同事们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}to communicate this to all your coworkers?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.90,0:32:56.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生  我愿意做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, sir, I will do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.63,0:32:59.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,付出一切来弥补\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will give anything to make this right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.18,0:33:02.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.63,0:33:20.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要我自噬吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bibbing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.80,0:33:35.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你能给我们什么吗  医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what you can give us, doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.59,0:33:38.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀鸡儆猴的教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your example.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.67,0:33:45.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening now?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.18,0:33:46.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.51,0:33:48.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.99,0:33:50.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.00,0:33:59.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我算是什么都见识过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I have officially seen it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.67,0:34:00.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.92,0:34:04.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们让医生吃掉了他自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's making the doctor eat himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.53,0:34:05.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.19,0:34:06.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's --
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.95,0:34:16.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们抓到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.96,0:34:20.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  那儿至少有四个利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, there are at least four leviathans out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.24,0:34:21.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们连一个都弄不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even know how to kill one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.52,0:34:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我们就从正门进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it'll be quite a shock
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.60,0:34:31.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定吓掉他们大牙  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we walk in through the front door, won't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.67,0:34:35.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喷气机在奥黑尔待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have the jet on standby at O'hare.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.48,0:34:36.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,周二早上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thursday morning, 
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.34,0:34:37.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要完成格里森的土地征用交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}you close on the land acquisition in Gleason.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.87,0:34:38.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.71,0:34:42.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而这是下午刚到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this came this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.04,0:34:43.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在苏富比买的  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Sotheby's. 
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.11,0:34:44.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.87,0:34:46.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  苏珊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Susan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.65,0:34:49.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  苏珊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and, Susan?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.41,0:34:51.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, tuh-tuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.65,0:35:04.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你没被绑起来  何必多此一举\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not tied up. Why waste the effort?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.86,0:35:06.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都清楚你是逃不出我手心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both know that you're not gonna get past me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.47,0:35:07.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你头还痛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.84,0:35:10.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们抓到了迪克·罗曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you got Dick Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.25,0:35:12.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要谁都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can have whoever we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.48,0:35:14.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如说  我们要你也行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could have you, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.20,0:35:16.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前提是你得值得我们费这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were worth the effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.26,0:35:18.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这话真伤人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're hurting my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.93,0:35:20.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界就是如此残酷  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a hard world, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.75,0:35:22.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我们吃狗的社会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an us-eat-dog world.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.58,0:35:23.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got there?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.70,0:35:26.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拍卖会上赢来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winning bid at auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.49,0:35:30.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.23,0:35:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以无与伦比的准头闻名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Known for their peerless sighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.62,0:35:38.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你是爱枪之人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I imagine you appreciate guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.55,0:35:40.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在有把我肯定爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd appreciate one right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.36,0:35:45.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我是泛指  枪的发明\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I mean the machine, the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.46,0:35:48.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们人类最富有创造力的一项发明之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one of your species' most inspired inventions.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.09,0:35:50.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说真的  我真觉得人类很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it. I really think you guys have spunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.54,0:35:51.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're like a planet
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.62,0:35:54.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像装着最可爱的小引擎\N{\fnArial\fs30}of just the cutest little engines that could.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.08,0:35:55.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.77,0:35:59.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正如前不久刚刚去世的真正的迪克·罗曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the late, great, actual Dick Roman used to say
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.04,0:36:02.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对他赶出总统套房的那个妓女所说的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the whores he'd kick out of the presidential suite...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.65,0:36:06.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再可爱也不行啊  甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Cute don't quite hack it, sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.71,0:36:09.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们少废话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, let's just cut to the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.78,0:36:12.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我显然不该多活这么长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I clearly ain't worth the extra time I'm getting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.51,0:36:15.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要吃了你  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna eat you, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.56,0:36:18.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.10,0:36:20.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我希望我的饭做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I like my meals prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.36,0:36:23.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说了  留着你还有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, holding on to you could pay big dividends.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.51,0:36:26.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我敢说你的朋友正赶来英雄救美呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet your friends are on their way to rescue the damsel.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.11,0:36:28.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们可聪明的很\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, they're too smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.14,0:36:30.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们知道你们人多\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know they don't have the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.81,0:36:32.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来就是找死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.14,0:36:35.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也潇洒过了  还可能死得更惨呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've run my race. Could die worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.36,0:36:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(强力清洁剂)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.54,0:37:08.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呆在这儿别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd stay in the chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.22,0:37:47.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, sons of bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.58,0:37:49.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看你们到底想干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what you're up to now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.66,0:37:52.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.80,0:38:16.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.73,0:38:20.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可不是好好谈话的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not how we communicate from a place of yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.07,0:38:23.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这感觉真爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was bracing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.26,0:38:25.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在哪儿找的这玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you kids find this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.55,0:38:32.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.59,0:38:35.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.22,0:38:40.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就不能别用那东西泼我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you stop it with that stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.78,0:38:49.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼  鲍比呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, where's Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.90,0:38:59.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.53,0:39:00.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.30,0:39:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.06,0:39:19.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.24,0:39:20.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好你进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you got in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.77,0:39:22.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他差点就爆了你的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}He almost took your freaking head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.86,0:39:26.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  给你帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bobby, your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.16,0:39:34.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.20,0:39:37.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god. Bobby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.75,0:39:38.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.22,0:39:40.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.47,0:39:42.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
